# vpn.list - hosts ALWAYS routed through the VPN (never DIRECT).
# Applies in BOTH modes; takes precedence over direct.list.
# Edits are watched by the active Windows routing service; existing sockets may reconnect.
#
# Entry shapes:
#   sourcecontrol.diyarme.com       plain host
#   *.diyarme.com                   wildcard
#   10.77.0.0/16                    CIDR
#   https://api.diyarme.com/v1/*    URL (routes the entire host)

